Package: yunmai-noble-simulator
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Vanuan <vanuan@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: adduser, yunmai-noble (= @VERSION@)
Recommends: yunmai-noble-desktop (= @VERSION@)
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: Virtual Yunmai scale for demos and testing
 Runs the yunmai-noble suite with its built-in simulator driver as a
 separate systemd service. The virtual scale listens on loopback port
 3100 and stores data in /var/lib/yunmai-noble-simulator, so it can run
 alongside the real Bluetooth service.
 .
 The package shares the runtime with yunmai-noble and only adds a
 service unit, a configuration file, a launcher, and a desktop entry.
